		"###.O.O.O.O.O.###k....#.....#....L#####D#D###",
		"###...........###..X..#.....#R.R..#.....#...#",
		"#.D.O.O.O.O.O.###k....#.....#######Z.X.k#...#",
		"#.#..TT.......D.#.....#L....#####.A.....#...#",
